          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{y}-\\frac{y}{x}&=\\frac{x^2}{xy}-\\frac{y^2}{xy}\\\\\\frac{x}{y}-\\frac{y}{x}&=\\frac{x^2-y^2}{xy}\\end{align*}$$",
